especially for just 120 kills per Rider.

  Mimics's and the wand/spell of sleep can be used to block a doorway.

  If you insist on boulders the best way is to polyself into a giant and
carry them from the Dungeon, or from the Plane of Earth (I believe
scrolls of earth will work on the Plane of Earth.  If so, it's the last
place they do.)

  Polyselfing into a giant is a great way to destroy your shirt, body
armor, and cloak.

